            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "Thank for suggestion!\r\n\r\nI have hard time picturing a whole workflow here. If there were distinction between \"code comments\" and \"documenting comments\" how would you expect to use them? If there is an option to pad or not to pad, it will be applied to any comment toggle. So you would be able to uncomment both code and document commented lines, but create comment only for one type (\"code comment\" if there is no padding; \"doc comment\" otherwise). Do you expect to be two mappings for two types of comments or do I misunderstand something here?",
